-- On a trial for theft (the s 12(4) kind): no limit.
#ASSERT (`Is it too late to bring proceedings against me for taking a vehicle without authority` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 1 2020) `a public prosecutor` (Date 1 3 2020) NOTHING (Date 1 1 2030)) EQUALS `section 12(4A) sets no limit on these proceedings`
-- Public prosecutor; evidence known 1 March 2020; commenced 31 August 2020, the last day of the six months.
#ASSERT (`Is it too late to bring proceedings against me for taking a vehicle without authority` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) `a public prosecutor` (Date 1 3 2020) NOTHING (Date 31 8 2020)) EQUALS `section 12(4A) allows these proceedings to be commenced`
-- The same, commenced 1 September 2020, one day after the six months end.
