-- The same, commenced 1 January 2023, after the three years.
#ASSERT (`Is it too late to bring proceedings against me for taking a vehicle without authority` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) `a public prosecutor` (Date 1 12 2022) NOTHING (Date 1 1 2023)) EQUALS `section 12(4A) bars these proceedings`
-- Private prosecutor after a discontinuance on 1 June 2020: the six months run from the later date, so 30 November 2020 is in time.
