-- The same, commenced 1 December 2020, after the six months from 1 June.
#ASSERT (`Is it too late to bring proceedings against me for taking a vehicle without authority` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2020) `another person, after a public prosecution on the same facts was discontinued` (Date 1 3 2020) (JUST (Date 1 6 2020)) (Date 1 12 2020)) EQUALS `section 12(4A) bars these proceedings`
-- A private prosecutor in any other case: the six months run from the day the evidence came to their knowledge.
