#ASSERT `Am I guilty of handling stolen goods` `the goods originally stolen, or parts of them` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- Arranges to receive them.
